# Frontend Conventions

## Stack

Vue 3 Composition API with `<script setup>`, Pinia stores, Vue Router, Tailwind CSS.

## Stores (`frontend/src/stores/`)

- `auth.js` — login + localStorage
- `todo.js` — CRUD, order, pinned/archived
- `tag.js` — tag CRUD
- `theme.js` — dark mode

Always `await` store actions that call the API.

## Composables (`frontend/src/composables/`)

Reuse existing: `useDragAndDrop`, `useSuggestions`, `useAI`, `useExport`, `useTodoFilters`, `useToast`, `useEmailInput`, `useMarkdown`.

## API URL

```javascript
const API_URL = `${import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL || 'http://localhost:3001'}/api`
```

## Router Guards

- `meta.requiresAuth` — logged-in only
- `meta.requiresGuest` — login page only

## UI Notes

- Dark mode: use `dark:` Tailwind variants
- SortableJS drag-and-drop works only when `viewMode === 'list'`
- Pinned todos always appear at top
